{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/extras/MEDI_Steam_Description-header_About_EN.png?t=1741622497\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Dark Ages, now in color! Medievaly is a real-time strategy game for everyone feeling a little bit Medievaly - or just wanting their own colorful kingdom to enjoy (while fending off relentless attacks from encroaching enemies).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/extras/MEDI-gif-06.gif?t=1741622497\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Come for the Middle Ages, stay for dynamic battle simulations where everything can happen, RTS mechanics, and a whole lot of tactical gameplay!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/extras/MEDI_Steam_Description-header_Features_EN.png?t=1741622497\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-Time Strategy Meets Simulated Battles</strong>: Every kingdom needs a base and yours is no exception! Set up defenses, expand infrastructure, then send out your men-at-arms to valiantly die under your banner in unpredictable, occasionally chaotic battles! Once they win, due to your tactical genius, use the gold harvested and won in battle to rally even more warriors to your banner!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/extras/MEDI-gif-05.gif?t=1741622497\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Medieval Tactical Warfare</strong>: It's not about the size of the longbow - or the pitchfork, or the lance, or the elephant, or... -\u00a0 but how it's used. Build up your army from seventeen distinct units, creating unique and exciting tactics that can turn the tide of the battle... Hopefully in your favor, my liege!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong>: Enjoy the campaign, building your kingdom up from a handful of villages to an empire bordering with whomever it wants. Want a challenge? How about breaching castles in violent sieges? Seeing who can get a hundred kills the fastest? Or a survival mode, where your fall is assured - the question is, how many foes will go to the ground with you?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/extras/MEDI-gif-02.gif?t=1741622497\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: The Sandbox mode allows you to customize every battle as you see fit, creating an endless variety of scenarios and challenges to test your skill in the art of war.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Brightest Dark Ages You've Seen Yet</strong>: Who said the medieval times were dark and glum? Enjoy the cartoony carnage in all its glory, with vibrant colors a medieval scribe would absolutely die for!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/extras/MEDI-gif-03.gif?t=1741622497\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3472300?t=1741622497","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/ef7df9d962c1e36631392279105ac76108aa8346/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741622497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472300/262f1760b4c23242da5ad8066363c821758d6b9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741622497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamst